      "artist": "shankar s. from Dubai, united arab emirates",
      "description": "A final look at the Temple of Artemis, or what remains of it. I was excited when I heard that we were going to see one of the Seven Wonders of the World. Seeing it in this condition  really floored me completely. I hope they build  a replica of it at least.  (Ephesus (Efes)/ Selcuk, Kusadasi, Turkey, Nov. 2014)",
